    <string name="about_body">What time should you get up tomorrow?\n\nIt depends on what you need to do before leaving: a shower, breakfast, walking the dog… You only know when you must be out of the door. Set your exit time, tick the activities you will do and Parakeet works out when to wake up and sets the alarm for you.\n\nIt\'s all you need to get up early, but not a minute earlier than necessary.</string>
