    <!-- 5.0 introduction -->
    <string name="whatsnew_title">Parakeet 5.0</string>
    <string name="whatsnew_body">Now Parakeet can ring the alarm by itself:\n• Choose the sound, vibration and snooze\n• Stop it by sliding, solving a sum, shaking the phone or scanning a QR code\n• It rings over the lock screen\n\nYour activities and exit time are kept. You can switch back to the Clock app in Settings.</string>
